us": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "我们来构造从右到左的函子（functor）。令<MATH_0001>为层（sheaves）的映射（map），这些层在<MATH_0002>上，且每个<MATH_0003>都是代数空间（algebraic space）。我们有投影<MATH_0004>。于是<MATH_0005>和<MATH_0006>都表示层（sheaf）<MATH_0007>，从而得到同构（isomorphism）\n<MATH_0008>\n容易看出，映射（maps）<MATH_0009>是<MATH_0010>上的态射（morphisms），并满足余循环条件（cocycle condition）。从右到左的函子（functor）由这一构造<MATH_0011>给出。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n我们来构造从左到右的函子（functor）。同构（isomorphisms）<MATH_0012>给出同构（isomorphisms）\n<MATH_0013>\n在<MATH_0014>上。令<MATH_0015>等于下列图（diagram）中的余等化子（coequalizer）\n<MATH_0016>\n余循环条件（cocycle condition）保证<MATH_0017>带有映射（map）<MATH_0018>，且<MATH_0019>同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0020>。从左到右的函子（functor）由这一构造<MATH_0021>给出。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n我们省略这些构造是互为拟逆（quasi-inverse）的函子（functors）的验证。最后的陈述(1)和(2)由这些构造得到。\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:97cebc6ad69e5509bc5fce5877f073e89b20918ced6b3b60b986d14e5f8a0382", "unit_id": "tag:0ADT:proof", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "两个方向的构造；待决。", "source_term": "functor", "target_term": "函子"}, {"context": "映射对象；待决。", "source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"context": "构造中的映射；待决。", "source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"context": "层的表示对象；待决。", "source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"context": "共同表示的对象；待决。", "source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"context": "下降数据；待决。", "source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"context": "数据的映射；待决。", "source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"context": "基底上的映射；待决。", "source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "下降相容条件；待决。", "source_term": "cocycle condition", "target_term": "余循环条件"}, {"context": "左到右构造；待决。", "source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"context": "余等化子构造；待决。", "source_term": "diagram", "target_term": "图"}, {"context": "层的构造；待决。", "source_term": "coequalizer", "target_term": "余等化子"}, {"context": "拉回对象的关系；待决。", "source_term": "isomorphic", "target_term": "同构"}, {"context": "两个构造的关系；待决。", "source_term": "quasi-inverse", "target_term": "拟逆"}, {"